# SCIENTIFIC WARNING
# ------------------
#
# A swing is retrospective.
#
# Example:
#
# Candidate swing index = 100
# SWING_LOOKBACK = 3
#
# The swing is not known at candle 100.
# It becomes confirmable only after the required future
# candles exist.
#
# Therefore:
#
#     Swing signal time = confirmation time
#
# not:
#
#     Swing signal time = swing center
#
# This prevents a major look-ahead error.
#
# BOS / CHoCH events are evaluated at their actual event
# index because the event itself is generated from a close
# breaking a previously confirmed structural level.
#
# ============================================================


